## Areas Confirmed Secure

| Area | Evidence |
|---|---|
| **Password Hashing** | BCrypt via `ApplicationConfig.java:47`. |
| **SQL Injection** | JPA parameterized queries. Full-text input sanitized in `JobService.java:46`. |
| **XSS (Backend)** | No user input echoed in errors. `escapeHtml()` in email templates. |
| **XSS (Frontend)** | Comprehensive `sanitization.ts`. React JSX escaping. |
| **File Upload** | Content-type, size, encryption, empty checks in `PdfParsingService.java`. In-memory only. |
| **IDOR / BOLA** | `@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN') or #userId == authentication.principal.id")`. All services use `getCurrentUserId()`. |
| **Account Lockout** | 5 attempts → 3-min lock. `REQUIRES_NEW` transaction. |
| **Error Responses** | `include-stacktrace=never`, `include-message=never`. Generic catch-all. |
| **Security Headers** | HSTS, X-Frame-Options DENY, nosniff, Referrer-Policy. `server_tokens off`. |
| **Token Storage** | `sessionStorage` (not `localStorage`). Cleared on tab close. |
| **Admin Endpoints** | Scraper, Swagger, GraphiQL all admin-protected or disabled. |
| **OTP Brute-Force** | Max 3 attempts, 1-min cooldown, atomic increment. |

---

## Unverified Concerns

| Concern | Why |
|---|---|
| `.env` / `.env.local` git history | Sandbox command execution failed. Run `git log --all -- .env .env.local`. |
| CVEs in `jjwt 0.11.5`, `pdfbox 2.0.29` | No online CVE access. Run `mvn dependency-check:check`. |
| Frontend `npm audit` | Not executed. Run `npm audit` in `frontend/`. |

